Why Insertion Sort Is Faster

\begin{frame}{Why Is Insertion Sort Faster?}
\begin{itemize}
  \item Both algorithms perform the same number of comparisons
  \item Bubble Sort uses swaps (3 memory writes per operation)
  \item Insertion Sort uses shifts (1 memory write per operation)
  \item Memory writes are more expensive than comparisons
\end{itemize}
\end{frame}






